('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.62',0,'।।18.62।।परोक्षवचनं तु द्रोणं प्रति भीमवचनवत्।'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.63',0,'।।18.63।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
